WEBVTT

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.260
I still can confirm his signal.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.000
Be OK, brother IV...

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.060
Believe in him now, that he will...

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:14.620
... bring back the man he did call his only friend.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:15.480
Yes...

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.930
Come on, IV!

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.430
I'll let you meet your friends in hell soon!

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:28.860
Bastard...

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.860
You bastard are the one going to hell! Nasch!

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.700
I'm gonna make you regret pissing me off that much for sure!

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:41.930
<i>That's good, IV. Hate me even more.</i>

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:47.710
By burying you this way, I will be a true Barian...

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.530
Here I come!

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:56.130
My turn! Draw!

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:06.260
Not yet... My luck hasn't run out yet!

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:10.800
Magic activate! Triangle Gimmick Box!

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:15.040
By banishing three Xyz Monsters from my graveyard,

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:20.020
I special summon a new Xyz Monster with its effects negated!

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:24.880
From my graveyard, I banish the Gimmick Puppets "Giant Killer", "Serial Killer"

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:26.800
and "Heaven's Strings".

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.880
Appear! Numbers 88!

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:34.350
Gimmick Puppet...

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.130
Destiny Leo!

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:40.890
Destiny Leo. Indeed, this monster...

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:45.070
has the effect that, when all it's Overlay Units are used,

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:48.000
it will win the duel, it's a powerful monster.

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:51.110
But right now, it can not use it's effect.

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:53.910
So, right now, your monster is...

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:56.200
like a Lion with it's fangs pulled out!

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:59.280
Right. That's why I am going to use this:

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:03.570
Rank-Up-Magic Argent Chaos Force, activate!

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:06.170
What, a Rank-Up for the third time?

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:13.860
I overlay my Rank 8 Destiny Leo!

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:17.660
I re-build the Overlay Network with this monster!

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:23.060
Chaos Xyz Change!
Appear, Chaos No. 88!

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:26.370
Howl, wild soul!

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:31.710
Awaken the rage that will destroy everything!

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.860
Gimmick Puppet Disaster Leo!

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.510
Chaos No. 88?

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:40.770
That guy...

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.910
He even got Destiny Leo chaosified!

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:45.450
{marker}

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:49.640
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:54.890
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:06.560
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:10.730
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:17.570
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:21.540
the feelings I want to express.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:30.550
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:33.820
Right now, with you

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:37.720
Oh - By facing each other,

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:44.830
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:49.900
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:55.320
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:03:56.620 --> 00:04:00.490
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:10.090
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:19.190
This is my strongest and final Trump Card!

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:21.860
Disaster Leo!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.780
Have you forgotten already, IV!?

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.700
No matter what Monster you have,

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:29.830
<i>Farewell, My Friend... Feelings Fallen into the Void!</i>

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:30.160
as long as my Dark Knight has Xyz Material, I am invincible!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.710
Sure, even if your monster is destroyed,

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:38.670
you can revive it and regain life equal to his ATK.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:41.590
But, will it work this time?!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.260
I activate Disaster Leo's effect!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.890
Once per turn, I can detach one Overlay Unit,

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.810
to inflict 4000 damage to the opposing player!

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:52.770
What?!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.270
Maximum Calamity!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.610
What an effect!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:10.080
If Nasch hadn't replenished his life, he would have sunk with a single blow!

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:15.160
Indeed... That monster is powerful...

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:18.040
... but I still have some life left!

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:22.050
No. This moment has fixed my win.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.340
What do you mean?

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.130
Don't you understand?

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:29.600
Disaster Leo inherited the power of Destiny Leo!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.060
The special win condition?

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:37.850
That's right. When Disaster Leo has no Overlay Units when a turn is over,

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:40.820
I have won the duel!

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:44.690
By now Disaster Leo has zero Xyz Material...

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.910
I will not battle and end my turn with this!

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:49.780
IV...

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.660
Nasch... With this, you are finished, bastard!

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:56.620
Final Crackdown!

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:07.880
Did it work!?

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:11.760
Nasch... with this... with this, you...

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:12.930
Not yet.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.230
This fight still isn't over.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.770
Impossible... How the... ?!

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:23.020
You should watch your monster closer!

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.940
Wha- what?!

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:28.650
Impossible... Disaster Leo' s Overlay Unit is...?

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:33.780
I activated my Continuous Trap "Overlay Award".

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.620
This card...

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:40.370
can detach an Overlay Unit from a Xyz Monster on my field

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.170
and give it to an opponent's Xyz Monster!

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:47.340
Thus, Disaster Leo's effect did not activate!

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.430
But Nasch...

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.090
Disaster Leo is unaffected by Monster Effects.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:54.680
So, in your turn,

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:58.100
you can't use Dark Knight's effect to absorb it.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:02.980
And if Dark Knight doesn't have any Chaos Overlay Units, it's not immortal anymore!

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:06.400
I'll finish this fight during my next turn!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.070
<i>IV, thank you...</i>

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:12.030
<i>Your hatred is driving me on...</i>

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.450
<i>... into the infernal abyss of no return.</i>

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.750
My turn! Draw!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.790
My destiny is still...

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:28.420
I activate the magic card Cross Draw of Destiny!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.880
This card lets both each draw one card.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.010
And when it is a monster,

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:38.430
it is special summoned in face-up Defense position on the opponent's field,

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.770
and the person who summoned it gains Life Points equal to its Attack!

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.270
<i>If I fail to draw a monster... I lose.</i>

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:49.150
<i>This literally </i>is<i> a Destiny Draw...</i>

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:52.530
I... I...

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:57.910
Here goes!

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:00.250
Draw!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.960
It seems like you didn't draw a monster, right?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:09.210
The one I drew is...

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:17.300
... destiny telling me to fight on.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:18.560
What?!

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.270
Take a good look, IV!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:22.770
This is precisely the card,

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:25.900
the one piece, that will let me live as a true Barian!

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.860
The one to let me say goodbye to my human heart!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.940
To his human heart...

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.780
<i>... the cheating champion of East Asia...</i>

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:38.410
<i>... Your friends have been killed one by one....</i>

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.830
You... don't tell me...!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:45.880
What I drew is... the monster card Silent Wobbe!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.880
With the effect of Cross Draw of Destiny,

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:52.300
Silent Wobbe is special summoned to your field!

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.550
And then my life...

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.220
will be replenished equal to it's ATK!

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:02.680
Then, Dark Knight's effect activates!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:05.600
Once per turn, one opponent's monster

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:08.770
can be turned into Dark Knight's Chaos Overlay Unit!

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.650
Dark Soul Over!

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.950
Dark Knight has a Chaos Overlay Unit...!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.700
I change Dark Knight into Attack Position!

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.580
Go, Dark Knight!

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.500
Attack Disaster Leo!

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.890
But because he had Chaos Overlay Units attached,

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.560
the destroyed Dark Knight is revived!

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.730
Return from Limbo!

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:56.570
Then the amount of DarK Knight's ATK will be added to my life!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.700
You suicided your monster to gain Life Points!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:11.790
I'm not done. From my hand, I activate the Quick-Play Spell Card, Power Stream!

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:17.760
This card becomes an Overlay Unit to a special summoned Water Xyz Monster that has battled!

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:20.010
Not too bad.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:23.850
As long as you have Overlay Award on your field,

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:27.940
you can pass on Overlay Units to Destiny Leo again,

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:31.060
to block off my special win conditions.

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:35.070
But remember, I also drew from Cross Draw of Destiny!

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.820
The card that'll shatter your destiny here and now!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:43.580
I activate the Quick-Play Spell Gimmick Vengeance from my hand!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.200
When an effect other than from an Xyz Monster

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:52.710
increases or decreases the Overlay Units from one opponent's Xyz Monster, this card activates!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:53.750
What?!

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:57.550
He is activating a Quick-Spell from his hand during the opponent's turn?!

00:10:57.760 --> 00:11:02.640
Then, with Gimmick Vengeance, the ATK of one Gimmick Puppet on the field

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:05.810
will be inflicted as damage to the opponent!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:11.600
With Disaster Leo, you take 3500 Damage!

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:16.400
Come back to us, Ryouga!

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.280
IV...

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:32.330
Just one breath further.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:36.130
... next turn... definitely...!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:37.210
Useless.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.590
There is no next turn for you.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.090
What do you mean?

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:45.890
Dark Knight was special summoned during Battle Phase...

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.560
and can still attack!

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.520
Of course I know that!

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:52.650
But...

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:56.980
your Dark Knight can't defeat my Disaster Leo!

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:58.610
Are you sure about that?

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.570
The Quick-Spell Power Stream.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.530
When the Monster that uses it as its Overlay Unit attacks,

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:09.080
it gains 1000 ATK!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:12.620
That's... 3800 ATK!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:17.840
I see... 
At that time with Cross-Draw of Destiny, you already...

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.590
Farewell... IV...

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:24.590
Dark Knight, attack Disaster Leo!

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:50.450
Yes, it is... I am understanding...

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.330
Yes, I did understand.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.350
IV...

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.850
You're some nasty bastard.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:19.020
For forcing yourself into a destiny you can't escape from,

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.030
you used me, huh.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.990
You noticed?

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:29.070
But, in the end, I couldn't change your destiny.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.330
From now on, you're going to fight Yuma and the guys...?

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.040
Yes. That's my destiny.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.670
Still a pity it turned out like that.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:41.670
Ohmy... Your destiny-thingy is...

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:46.510
But in the end, I am glad I could do this with you.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:51.810
I am off before you, I'll wait for you in hell... Ryouga...

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.180
<i>IV...</i>

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.310
<i>Everyone...</i>

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.360
<i>You all just should not do this.</i>

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.650
<i>When this fight is over...</i>

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.610
<i>... soon I too will die.</i>

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:13.240
Oh, he woke up.

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:16.660
Kotori.. where am...

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.080
Yuma...you're awake, yes?

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.210
I... just what the...

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:24.880
We're in the car V is driving.

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:27.130
You were tired from all the fights

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:30.550
and fainted when the Seven Emperors appeared.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:36.980
Yeah... Back then, Shark's consciousness came flowing into me...

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.310
Wait, the Seven Emperors? Is everyone safe?

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:45.110
Eh... where's Tetsuo? And IV?

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:49.280
They both stayed behind to let us escape.

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:50.910
What do you mean?!

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.950
What's that supposed to mean?! Hey, Astral!

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:59.420
Brother! Brother IV's Signal is...!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.340
He... Hey!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.550
What do you mean by IV's signal is gone?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.310
With this, those still possessing Numbers are

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:27.110
Yuma with Astral and then Kaito, V and III.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:29.740
Listen, we absolutely...

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.570
have to search them everywhere.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.580
Let's settle this, Yuma!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:42.250
Nasch's power, indeed I just can't afford to underestimate it.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:46.710
If they get together, then even I won't be able to...

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:51.010
Well, then, time to be up to no good?

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:55.300
That's... it's a lie, right...

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:59.100
Not just IV, but Tetsuo and everyone else?

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:04.520
How can this... How can something like this be!

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.690
Damn...!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.570
It's my fault...

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.990
It's my fault that everyone is...

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.860
Everyone is...!

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:14.660
That's wrong... It's not your fault, Yuma...

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.490
No.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:19.950
It's our fault!

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:21.080
Kaito...

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:24.080
Why should we start sugarcoating the facts at this point.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.500
You're not the only one suffering!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.050
V... III...

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:33.720
You're right. Yuma, if you become weak now, then IV...

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.260
... no, Thomas, and everyone have died in vain!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:42.600
But why is Shark our enemy all of a sudden?

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.600
I don't know. But he is a Barian.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.900
We can't avoid the fight...

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:52.110
Even if the guy is Barian, but we still are friends!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:55.030
You'd still fight against him, even then!?

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:55.950
That guy...!

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.240
That guy defeated IV, who was his friend!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.870
You still don't get that he's serious?!

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:08.920
Kaito... even if Shark is feeling serious about that, he <i>still</i> is our friend.

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:11.550
That's why, how do I say that...

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:14.970
... it's not good giving up on understanding each other's feelings.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:19.010
If we don't give up, we might find another way for sure!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:23.480
Another way so we can avoid fighting Shark and the others!

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:25.850
<i>A way to avoid fighting...</i>

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.940
Yuma, but how...?

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:30.690
Tha-... that's...

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:32.480
There might be one.

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.990
A way to avoid a fight with the Seven Barian Emperors.  That would be...

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:41.490
... to defeat Don Thousand directly by ourselves.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.200
Don Thousand...?

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:44.450
Who is that?

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:48.750
Don Thousand is a god of the Barians.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:54.050
His power was sealed long ago, but...

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.260
... based on what's going on now,

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.180
his powers seem to have been revived.

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:02.180
Probably Don Thousand is using the Seven Emperors as pawns

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:05.060
to bring himself back into power.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:09.810
Then Don Thousand's the mastermind behind everything and if we defeat him...

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:13.900
There might be a chance that we can avoid fighting the Seven Emperors.

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:17.860
Awesome! Don Thousand is in the Barian World, right?

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.490
Then, if we too-

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.030
Sorry, I can't go.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.830
Wha-... why, Kaito?

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.710
Let's go, Orbital.
A- at your service.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.040
I still have something that must be done.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.750
That's... What the heck would you have to do...

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.460
Hey, Kaito!

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.510
Hey, say something, Kaito!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.890
Kaito!

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:45.310
Yuma.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:48.600
We won't go with you either.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:52.730
Me and III have a score to settle with the Seven Emperors.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.280
Wha-... what do you mean?

00:18:55.480 --> 00:19:00.110
You can't understand our rage that our own flesh and blood was defeated after all, don't you?

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:05.160
That's... You guys should know better how empty revenge is!

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.580
You are the one who doesn't understand!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:08.750
III...!

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:12.250
We have to avenge our brother with our own hands.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:15.460
I'm not a coward like you!

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:20.430
Yuma... I am fed up with... talking to you.

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:26.430
If you regret this, try prove your way to us!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.900
Why are they suddenly...?

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:38.320
I don't know. But...

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.030
... to duel with so much hatred...

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:44.280
I'm definitely going to change that!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.740
Well, let's go.

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:50.330
From here on it's just Yuma and me.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.870
Kotori and you guys should go home.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:59.170
Guys, tell my Granny and so what's going on.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.380
And that they shouldn't worry about me!

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.760
Um... Yuma... I...

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:08.680
It's all right, Kotori! I definitely will...

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.100
Go<i>purr</i> with them, Kotori.

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:13.900
Keep him company!

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.190
Wha... what!?
Wha... what!?

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:22.110
Kotori, I entrust Yuma to you, right!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.160
You must never leave him alone!

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:27.620
If you leave him, I'll downright eat you for sure!

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:31.580
Cat-<i>chan</i>... yes!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:40.380
In conclusion, why did you do this?

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.510
Because I...

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.590
Because I want to go too...

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:44.970
But then...

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:49.310
What could I really do there... just nothing.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:53.560
What Kotori prepared for us... Is this...

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:58.690
... some Sushi?

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:01.940
It's not. It's Duel Rice Balls.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.700
Really? They are very good!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:07.070
III, I am sorry...

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.160
... that you had to part with Yuma in such a way.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.660
There was no other way.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:16.000
Because the Barians have almost caught up with us.

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:20.750
If Yuma knew, he would get into the fight for sure.

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:25.340
But now, Yuma and the others have found a new hope.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:30.100
They are the only ones who can put an end to this fight.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:34.430
Until they are safe on their way, we have to attract those guys.

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:40.230
Brother, you too believe in Yuma, right?

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:46.070
I have bet everything on Yuma's power to believe in people!

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:50.990
You there! Where are Yuma and Kaito?

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:54.450
If you want to know, you're going to have to defeat us!

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:57.670
You want to bear my Neo Tachyon some company?

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:00.340
You won't know, if you don't try!

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:04.550
Besides, if we run away now, bother Thomas would laugh at us!

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:08.430
That's right. Thomas is waiting in <i>hell</i>!

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:10.180
{marker}

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:11.850
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:16.230
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:18.520
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:22.150
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:24.820
Let it go.

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:38.040
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:43.250
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.130 --> 00:22:49.180
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.180 --> 00:22:54.510
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:59.350
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:05.230
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:07.400
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:11.780
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:15.660
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.450
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.880
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:24.040
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:26.840
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.260
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:32.800
Challenge the GAME

00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:44.400
Before Misael, V and III join in for battle!

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:47.360
They are facing Tachyon Dragon's overwhelming power,

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:50.320
but they have a secret plan to seal it!

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:52.570
This is... for the revenge...?

00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:54.620
Did they return to the way they are before?

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:56.030
Don't tell me, they...

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:58.580
Are you telling me that Yuma is heading towards Barian world?!

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:01.000
Next on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II:

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:04.130
The Unflinching Brother Combo - Tachyon Dragon Imprisoned!!

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:08.050
I'll let you see the winning blow from me and my brother!
